WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.692
Unit seven. Puberty and Body Changes!

2
00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:08.379
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:11.879
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:16.134
Today we learn about Puberty and Body Changes. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.924 --> 00:00:20.541
Puberty. Say it with me. Puberty!

6
00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:27.897
Hormones. Say it with me. Hormones!

7
00:00:31.401 --> 00:00:35.101
Growth spurt. Say it with me. Growth spurt!

8
00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:41.975
Voice. Say it with me. Voice!

9
00:00:45.482 --> 00:00:49.349
Body hair. Say it with me. Body hair!

10
00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:56.780
Emotions. Say it with me. Emotions!

11
00:01:00.271 --> 00:01:03.754
Normal. Say it with me. Normal!

12
00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:10.644
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

13
00:01:14.162 --> 00:01:26.230
During puberty, hormones cause a growth spurt, body hair, and changes in voice. Emotions can change quickly too. These changes are normal, and everyone deserves respect.

14
00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.785
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:34.604
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.654 --> 00:01:35.879
Growth spurt!

17
00:01:36.944 --> 00:01:42.152
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:43.352
Normal!

19
00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:49.906
Did you know? Boys and girls often go through puberty at different ages and speeds!

20
00:01:49.956 --> 00:01:51.939
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.682 --> 00:02:00.933
Think and answer. Why should we never tease others about body changes?

22
00:02:00.983 --> 00:02:02.133
Great answer!

23
00:02:03.182 --> 00:02:08.503
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:08.553 --> 00:02:11.374
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

